      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZELDA CHAOS (1) is drawn well on the inside. Latest effort finished 4th on August 11 over 383m at this track behind Ritza Duane beaten 5.5 lengths (22.45) in a Grade 3/4. Looks a leading chance and expected to go close. BING BING CHARM (2) missed the frame last time when fourth (18.45) at this track in a Grade 4 but not beaten far the start prior. Expected to bounce back to best. TRUST ME (8) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 4.5 lengths back in third (31.75) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 537m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. HERE COMES FOXY (3) has hardly put a foot wrong of late and will be competitive again.",
